For i2c used for writting/reading data to/from register address of slave device:

Note for ARDY indications:
W: STT + Slave address (+ ACK) + register address W (+ ACK) + data (+ ACK) (+ ARDY) + STP
R: STT + Slave address (+ ACK) + register address W (+ ARDY) (+ ACK) (+ ARDY) + register address R (+ ACK) + data (+ NACK) (+ ARDY) + STP

+ Can check by see by the number of jumps of ardy for interrupt: 1 ardy IRQ for write and 3 ardy IRQ for read.
+ 1 additional ardy is needed for re-configuring from master transmit to master recieve
